Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.44,0:01:32.52,main,Loid,0,0,0,,The time has come.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.80,0:01:34.24,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Let us check our personal effects.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.85,0:01:36.08,main,Yor,0,0,0,,All clear, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.08,0:01:37.58,main,Loid,0,0,0,,And now, our appearances.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.59,0:01:40.84,main,Yor,0,0,0,,All clear, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.84,0:01:42.78,main,Loid,0,0,0,,And a final check of our verbal etiquette.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.78,0:01:44.53,main,Anya,0,0,0,,All set, please. Will do my best, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.53,0:01:48.10,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,I feel nothing but anxiety about this,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.57,0:01:50.69,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,but we've done everything we could.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.30,0:01:55.23,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,Now, onward...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.84,0:02:00.34,sign_6041_79_OPERATION_STRIX,Caption,0,0,0,,{\fscx40\pos(412,285)}THE PRESTIGIOUS SCHOOL'S INTERVIEW
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.36,0:01:58.39,italicstop,Loid,0,0,0,,To Eden College's interview!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.34,0:02:01.55,main,Yor,0,0,0,,It's so big!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.80,0:02:04.44,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Well, it is one of this country's top schools.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.44,0:02:06.71,main,Yor,0,0,0,,And there are so many examinees...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.97,0:02:08.56,main,Loid,0,0,0,,They're all our rivals.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.00,0:02:11.12,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Anya, are you going to \Nbe okay in this crowd?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.12,0:02:12.49,main,Anya,0,0,0,,I'll be okay, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.63,0:02:14.43,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Let us go, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.01,0:02:17.29,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,This feeling...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.74,0:02:18.69,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,There's no doubt about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.33,0:02:21.58,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,I've experienced this many times.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.69,0:02:25.82,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,Someone is watching us. Could it be...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.10,0:02:27.82,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,Is there an enemy hidden in this crowd?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.82,0:02:28.58,italics,Anya,0,0,0,,An enemy?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.58,0:02:30.11,italics,Yor,0,0,0,,I feel someone's gaze...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.68,0:02:32.55,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,No, that's not it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.86,0:02:35.92,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,I'm not the only one being watched.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.92,0:02:38.18,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,It's always an unpleasant \Nfeeling to be observed like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.18,0:02:40.27,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,There.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.73,0:02:41.96,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,Four in the overhead passage.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.28,0:02:43.35,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,Four in the bell tower.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.60,0:02:45.65,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,More in the buildings to the left and right.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.42,0:02:50.24,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,I have information on most \Nof the staff at this school.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.67,0:02:53.16,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,Those... are the instructors.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.57,0:02:58.09,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,They're observing every action that \Neveryone is taking and scoring them
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.09,0:02:59.90,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,to see if they're worthy of this school.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.90,0:03:03.13,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,Which means... the exam has already begun.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.69,0:03:05.64,main,Loid,0,0,0,,I need you two to be on your guard.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.64,0:03:07.47,main,Loid,0,0,0,,We're being watched by the examiners.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.47,0:03:08.28,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.65,0:03:10.04,main,Loid,0,0,0,,We'll do this just as we practiced.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.59,0:03:12.61,main,Instructor A,0,0,0,,D-68, fail.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.61,0:03:14.03,main,Instructor B,0,0,0,,A-12, fail.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.03,0:03:15.67,main,Instructor D,0,0,0,,G-114, pass.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.67,0:03:18.30,main,Henderson,0,0,0,,I must say, the examinees \Nthis year lack refinement.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.06,0:03:21.71,main,Henderson,0,0,0,,They all lack true elegance.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.71,0:03:24.10,main,Teachers,0,0,0,,Good morning, Housemaster.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.97,0:03:24.09,sign_5367_29_Code_Name__Twili,Caption,0,0,0,,{\blur2\pos(485,170)}Eden College\N{\fs30\fsp0}<Housemaster>
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.42,0:03:26.53,main,Henderson,0,0,0,,It displeases me to know their crude feet
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.53,0:03:29.19,main,Henderson,0,0,0,,are trudging upon the blessed \Nground of our school.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.72,0:03:32.16,main,Henderson,0,0,0,,Elegance creates tradition.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.16,0:03:35.89,main,Henderson,0,0,0,,Elegance is what truly makes \Nthis world a paradise.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.89,0:03:38.50,main,Henderson,0,0,0,,Fail any family lacking \Nelegance immediately.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.50,0:03:39.10,main,Instructor B,0,0,0,,Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.81,0:03:40.71,main,Henderson,0,0,0,,Hm?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.71,0:03:43.95,main,Henderson,0,0,0,,Oho...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.24,0:03:50.93,main,Henderson,0,0,0,,It appears that not all hope has been lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.95,0:03:55.93,main,Henderson,0,0,0,,They are paying their respects \Nto the statue of our founder?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.13,0:03:58.67,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,I, Twilight, am a man of a thousand faces.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.67,0:04:02.63,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,Becoming exactly the person my target \Nwants me to be is mere child's play.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.63,0:04:03.66,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,Behold!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.96,0:04:06.76,italics,Yor,0,0,0,,I haven't the slightest clue \Nas to who this gentleman is,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.76,0:04:10.17,italics,Yor,0,0,0,,but everything should be fine as \Nlong as I do what Loid is doing.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.17,0:04:11.43,italics,Anya,0,0,0,,Baldy head!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.56,0:04:15.28,main,Henderson,0,0,0,,S-So elegant!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.52,0:04:17.52,main,Henderson,0,0,0,,How very elegant!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.75,0:04:19.61,main,Henderson,0,0,0,,Who is that family?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.61,0:04:22.28,main,Instructor D,0,0,0,,K-212. They are the Forgers, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.28,0:04:26.71,main,Instructor D,0,0,0,,Their daughter Anya just barely passed \Nthe written exam with a score of 31.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.71,0:04:29.77,main,Henderson,0,0,0,,Absolutely not elegant! \NAnd such awful penmanship!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.25,0:04:33.93,main,Henderson,0,0,0,,So the father has remarried?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.93,0:04:36.67,main,Instructor B,0,0,0,,Might they be an impromptu \Nfamily for admission purposes?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.06,0:04:39.51,main,Henderson,0,0,0,,I am not certain. We must investigate.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.81,0:04:43.50,main,Henderson,0,0,0,,We must ascertain whether \Nor not they have true elegance.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.81,0:04:45.50,top,Instructor E,0,0,0,,We'll confirm your admission numbers here.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.50,0:04:48.48,main,Instructor F,0,0,0,,G-114. Please go to Hall 1.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.48,0:04:51.43,main,Instructor F,0,0,0,,Ah, A-12. Please enter Hall 2.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.26,0:04:54.63,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,I see they're wasting no \Ntime with the screening.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.98,0:04:58.94,main,Instructor F,0,0,0,,K-212. Please head to Hall 1.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.19,0:05:02.94,main,Loid,0,0,0,,We're still being observed. \NDon't let your guard down.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.20,0:05:05.72,main,Yor,0,0,0,,It's so nerve-racking \Nbeing watched like this...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.72,0:05:07.79,main,Anya,0,0,0,,I need to pick my nose.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.79,0:05:08.92,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Absolutely not.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.92,0:05:11.08,main,Boy,0,0,0,,Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.08,0:05:14.62,top,Boy,0,0,0,,I've accidentally fallen into \Nthe gutter, and I can't get out!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.56,0:05:17.32,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,Uh... That's too blatant if \Nthey're trying to test us.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.62,0:05:17.48,top,Boy,0,0,0,,Oh, no. Whatever shall I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.32,0:05:19.33,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,Perhaps they're thinking \Nhe might be a threat,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.48,0:05:19.33,top,Boy,0,0,0,,Ah, I don't know what I should do.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.33,0:05:21.21,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,but no one is trying to go near him.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.33,0:05:23.15,top,Boy,0,0,0,,Who knew there'd be a gutter here?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.21,0:05:24.66,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,But if he is part of the test, \Nwe must deal with this accordingly.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.15,0:05:27.88,top,Boy,0,0,0,,I'm so shocked. I'm really stuck.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.06,0:05:30.38,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Papa! Mama! There is someone \Nwho needs our help, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.38,0:05:31.60,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Let us save him!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.60,0:05:33.14,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Are you all right, lad?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.39,0:05:40.01,main,Boy,0,0,0,,Oh, no! I've slipped and I cannot get up!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.49,0:05:39.44,italicstop,Boy Internal,0,0,0,,This is all for merits... More merits!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.35,0:05:41.49,italics,Henderson,0,0,0,,Precisely.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.49,0:05:45.76,italics,Henderson,0,0,0,,You're heading to an interview. You wouldn't\N dare sully your clothes with sewage.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.76,0:05:49.03,italics,Henderson,0,0,0,,Now, how will you elegantly get through—
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.42,0:05:56.86,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Are you hurt?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.86,0:05:58.51,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Use my hanky, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.03,0:06:01.37,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Make sure you go to \Nthe infirmary, just in case.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.96,0:06:04.54,italics,Henderson,0,0,0,,Clearly, I expected too much.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.54,0:06:07.29,italics,Henderson,0,0,0,,In the end, they were just some \Ncommoners from the countryside.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.29,0:06:09.05,italics,Henderson,0,0,0,,Do not think for a second that you can
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.05,0:06:11.56,italics,Henderson,0,0,0,,set foot in our house of \Nlearning wearing soiled clothes.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.00,0:06:14.64,main,Henderson,0,0,0,,Throw K-212 out immediately.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.12,0:06:18.85,italics,Boy,0,0,0,,Oh, no... These people are \Ngoing to fail because of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.85,0:06:20.39,main,Boy,0,0,0,,Um, I'm so sorr—
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.39,0:06:21.97,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Thank goodness we anticipated this,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.33,0:06:25.27,main,Yor,0,0,0,,and prepared a change of \Nclothes just in case!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.27,0:06:28.79,italics,Henderson,0,0,0,,Who in the world would \Never anticipate that?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.48,0:06:33.82,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Besides, your grey suit seems to \Nfit the attire at this school more.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.82,0:06:35.58,main,Loid,0,0,0,,If I had continued wearing my previous suit,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.58,0:06:38.21,main,Loid,0,0,0,,we would've been mistaken for \Ncommoners from the countryside.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.21,0:06:41.39,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Thank you for giving us the \Nopportunity to change, lad.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.80,0:06:45.48,main,Henderson,0,0,0,,On top of everything else,\N they even thanked the boy!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.48,0:06:50.38,main,Henderson,0,0,0,,Brilliant... So smart, and elegant!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.78,0:06:53.38,main,Henderson,0,0,0,,Curse you and your cunning, Loid Forger.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.38,0:06:56.11,main,Instructor B,0,0,0,,Housemaster, we are supposed \Nto be testing the child.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.11,0:06:56.94,main,Henderson,0,0,0,,Silence!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.17,0:06:59.04,main,Henderson,0,0,0,,Children learn from their parents' example!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.35,0:07:03.53,main,Henderson,0,0,0,,Yes. The parents of a child who scores 30 \Npoints must also be only worth 30 points!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.13,0:07:06.64,main,Henderson,0,0,0,,I'll make you reveal your true identity yet!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.55,0:07:11.08,main,Man,0,0,0,,Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.36,0:07:14.11,main,Man,0,0,0,,The animals have escaped the farmhouse!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.45,0:07:17.41,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,You're really going this far, Eden College?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.71,0:07:20.20,main,Mob 1,0,0,0,,Hey, don't push me!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.71,0:07:20.93,top,Mob 2,0,0,0,,Just go, you moron!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.20,0:07:22.67,top,Mob 4,0,0,0,,Mommy! Mommy, Mommy!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.93,0:07:21.90,top,Mob 3,0,0,0,,Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.15,0:07:23.47,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,Are they trying to see if we reveal \Nour true selves in an emergency?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.75,0:07:26.18,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,We'll be playing right into the \Nexaminers' hands if we panic.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.61,0:07:28.33,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Do not break Formation D.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.65,0:07:31.02,main,Loid,0,0,0,,We will show these animals\N nothing but benevolence!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.61,0:07:32.18,main,Henderson,0,0,0,,Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.41,0:07:34.67,main,Henderson,0,0,0,,Who told you to go that far?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.67,0:07:35.18,main,Instructor D,0,0,0,,Wait...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.18,0:07:36.50,main,Instructor D,0,0,0,,It wasn't you, Housemaster?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.88,0:07:39.64,italics,Henderson,0,0,0,,Impossible! Is this...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.92,0:07:42.11,italics,Henderson,0,0,0,,an actual accident?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.11,0:07:44.98,main,Henderson,0,0,0,,There are some very important \Npeople among the examinees!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.98,0:07:47.03,main,Henderson,0,0,0,,Go stop this mess before they're hurt!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.03,0:07:49.37,main,Vice Minister,0,0,0,,I'm the Vice Minister of \Nthe Ministry of Finance!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.37,0:07:52.73,main,Banker,0,0,0,,Hell if I care! I'm the \NCEO of the Central Bank!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.87,0:07:54.54,top,Child A,0,0,0,,Wait! Father!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.86,0:07:59.90,top,Vice Minister,0,0,0,,Well done, you!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.34,0:07:59.48,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Are you all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.02,0:08:01.99,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Loid!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.99,0:08:03.62,main,Yor,0,0,0,,It's happening to Miss Anya again.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.93,0:08:06.12,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,The mass panic must've hit her.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.71,0:08:08.86,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,The test is the last thing \NI need to worry about now.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.66,0:08:13.13,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,That must be the leader of this herd.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.13,0:08:16.02,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,That's the one I need to stop, \Nbut I'll have to use my gun—
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.02,0:08:16.67,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,No...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.74,0:08:19.65,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Please look after Miss Anya for a moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.65,0:08:20.67,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Yor?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.50,0:08:42.19,main,Yor,0,0,0,,I-It's not what you think!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.19,0:08:45.83,main,Yor,0,0,0,,I once learned about pressure points that \Ncan stop one's movements in a yoga class!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.83,0:08:48.24,main,Yor,0,0,0,,I-I figured they might work on cows, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.66,0:08:50.27,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Please don't look at me like that!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.43,0:08:52.51,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Ms. Cow?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.51,0:08:54.21,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Is she scared?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.36,0:08:57.79,main,Loid,0,0,0,,That's dangerous, Anya!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.60,0:09:04.65,main,Anya,0,0,0,,S'okay, please. Don't be scared.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.14,0:09:08.38,main,Loid,0,0,0,,What are you—
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.42,0:09:16.14,main,Anya,0,0,0,,They're gonna go home now.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.26,0:09:18.52,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Apparently so.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.88,0:09:21.16,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Thankfully, no one was hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.64,0:09:23.29,main,Henderson,0,0,0,,E-Ele...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.29,0:09:26.88,main,Henderson,0,0,0,,Ele-le... Ele-le-le-le...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.88,0:09:29.68,main,Henderson,0,0,0,,{\i1}Elegance{\i0}!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.57,0:09:32.43,main,Instructor B,0,0,0,,Housemaster?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.93,0:09:34.51,main,Henderson,0,0,0,,Forger!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.81,0:09:36.77,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,He's...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.09,0:09:38.76,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,one of the housemasters.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.76,0:09:40.53,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,Is he in charge of this exam?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.15,0:09:43.98,main,Henderson,0,0,0,,Y-You helped us avoid a crisis. I thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.98,0:09:47.64,main,Henderson,0,0,0,,And... you have bested me for today.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.60,0:09:51.50,main,Henderson,0,0,0,,To give us all time to collect \Nourselves after this chaos,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.50,0:09:53.82,main,Henderson,0,0,0,,we will be delaying the \Nstart of the interviews.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.16,0:09:56.92,main,Henderson,0,0,0,,Return to your hall once you've \Nhad a moment to tidy yourselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.25,0:10:00.95,main,Henderson,0,0,0,,Your family has the right \Nto apply to our school.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.79,0:10:03.06,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Sir...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.06,0:10:05.44,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,It looks like we've avoided failure.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.27,0:10:08.54,main,Loid,0,0,0,,I humbly thank you for your generosity.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.54,0:10:10.65,main,Loid,0,0,0,,But have no fear.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.81,0:10:13.45,main,Loid,0,0,0,,We anticipated something like this...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.57,0:10:16.77,main,Loid,0,0,0,,and prepared another change of clothes.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.89,0:10:22.29,italics,Henderson,0,0,0,,This isn't about elegance anymore! \NThese people are just scary!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.29,0:10:25.62,italics,Narrator,0,0,0,,The Forgers successfully make \Nit to the actual interview.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.37,0:10:31.80,main,Swan,0,0,0,,You truly thought you could apply to \Nour school without even knowing that?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.80,0:10:32.65,main,Child B,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.65,0:10:34.87,main,Swan,0,0,0,,Well? Cat got your tongue?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.87,0:10:35.77,main,Child B,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.06,0:10:38.07,italics,Child B,0,0,0,,Um, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.62,0:10:41.73,main,Father D,0,0,0,,Thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.28,0:10:45.16,main,Father D,0,0,0,,What kind of answer was that?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.61,0:10:48.76,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,I've been a spy for over a decade,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.76,0:10:50.09,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,and for the first time...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.48,0:10:51.80,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,I'm actually nervous.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.75,0:10:55.67,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,Even when I infiltrated the ranks \Nof an evil terrorist group,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.43,0:11:00.84,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,or when I managed to stop the launch of \Na missile with one second remaining...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.31,0:11:03.73,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,I never found it so hard to \Nbreathe as I do right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.28,0:11:07.10,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,The fear of letting someone else \Ndecide my success or failure...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.88,0:11:11.09,main,Instructor G,0,0,0,,Next, the Forgers.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.44,0:11:12.27,top,Anya,0,0,0,,Yep!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.44,0:11:12.27,main,Loid and Yor,0,0,0,,Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.29,0:11:16.21,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,Yes, this is definitely going to be...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.16,0:11:20.59,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,the most crucial moment of Operation Strix!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.37,0:11:18.93,top,Evans,0,0,0,,Please, have a seat.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.16,0:11:22.50,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Thank you for having us.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.79,0:11:24.78,italics,Henderson,0,0,0,,So you've come, Forgers.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.78,0:11:28.90,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,The Forgers shall prevail in this\N game of information warfare.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.15,0:11:35.62,main,Evans,0,0,0,,First, we will begin by asking \Nthe parents a few questions.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.88,0:11:44.76,sign_5367_29_Code_Name__Twili,Sign,0,0,0,,{\an7\pos(339,220)\blur2\3c&HFFFFFF&\3a&H7D&\fsp4\fad(273,1)}Walter Evans (59)\N\N{\fs11\fsp0}\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\hHousemaster of Dorm 5 <Malcom Hall>\N\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\hSubject Taught: English\N\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h{\fscx85}Personality: Mild-mannered • Sincere • Conservative
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.14,0:11:38.97,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,The housemaster of Dorm 5, Malcom Hall.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.97,0:11:41.57,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,Mild-mannered, sincere, and conservative.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.57,0:11:43.52,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,The students are very fond of him.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.03,0:11:47.30,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,As long as we respond with \Nsincere, logical answers,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.30,0:11:49.16,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,we'll score highly with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.16,0:11:53.85,main,Evans,0,0,0,,I was informed that this is your second \Nwife. May I ask how you two met?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.85,0:11:56.21,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,I see we're getting straight to the point.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.21,0:11:58.61,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,Eden College does prioritize \Nfamily values, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.28,0:12:03.97,main,Loid,0,0,0,,I met my wife at the tailor shop that \Nhandles this school's uniforms,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.62,0:12:07.37,main,Loid,0,0,0,,and I was in awe of her grace.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.17,0:12:10.40,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Ever since I lost my first wife,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.40,0:12:13.05,main,Loid,0,0,0,,I was hesitant to pursue another \Nrelationship because of my daughter.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.55,0:12:16.85,main,Loid,0,0,0,,But the more we spoke, the more \NI felt that she was a kindred spirit.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.40,0:12:21.79,main,Loid,0,0,0,,She is truly kind and cares \Ndearly about family.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.79,0:12:24.50,main,Loid,0,0,0,,I came to the conclusion that she'd \Nget along well with my daughter.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.50,0:12:27.35,main,Evans,0,0,0,,Ah... And what about you, Madam?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.08,0:12:28.97,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.32,0:12:33.87,main,Yor,0,0,0,,L-Loid is a wonderful person who \Ntruly cares for his daughter.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.87,0:12:36.85,main,Yor,0,0,0,,He's also very considerate of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.85,0:12:40.69,main,Evans,0,0,0,,Ah, I'm happy to hear that you \Nhave such a loving family.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.69,0:12:45.29,main,Swan,0,0,0,,Why would a beautiful girl like you choose \Nto be with a man who's got baggage?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.29,0:12:48.10,main,Henderson,0,0,0,,That was rather uncouth, Master Swan.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.78,0:12:57.13,sign_5367_29_Code_Name__Twili,Sign,0,0,0,,{\an7\pos(355,220)\blur2\3c&HFFFFFF&\3a&H7D&\fsp.8\fad(273,1)}Murdoch Swan (47)\N{\fs11\fsp0}\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\hHousemaster of Dorm 2 <Cline Hall>\N\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\hSubject Taught: Economics\N\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\hPersonality: Arrogant • Greedy • Callous
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.61,0:12:51.37,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,The housemaster of Dorm 2, Cline Hall.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.37,0:12:55.45,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,He's the only son of the former \Nheadmaster, and a legacy hire.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.45,0:12:58.38,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,Arrogant, greedy, and callous.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.38,0:13:01.30,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,His wife filed for divorce last month,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.30,0:13:03.46,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,and he just lost custody \Nof his daughter, as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.21,0:13:06.79,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,Reviewing all of his previous \Ninterview questions and comments,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.79,0:13:10.00,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,he is clearly jealous of other families,\N and takes out his frustrations on them.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.97,0:13:13.52,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,It's best that we avoid provoking him.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.52,0:13:15.27,main,Evans,0,0,0,,Now for our next question.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.47,0:13:19.24,main,Evans,0,0,0,,Could you tell us why you \Nchose to apply to our school?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.24,0:13:20.07,main,Loid,0,0,0,,For only one reason, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.34,0:13:22.88,italics,Loid Internal,0,0,0,,To get close to my target, Desmond!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.98,0:13:25.00,top,Loid,0,0,0,,The quality of the instructors at \Nthis establishment is superior.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.40,0:13:28.37,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Of course, you are all very \Nknowledgeable and cultured,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.37,0:13:33.07,main,Loid,0,0,0,,but when it comes to teaching anything, \Nfrom patriotism to how to be an elite,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.47,0:13:36.34,main,Loid,0,0,0,,the instructors of the \Nprestigious Eden College
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.34,0:13:38.50,main,Loid,0,0,0,,are second to none.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.50,0:13:44.09,sign_5367_29_Code_Name__Twili,Sign,0,0,0,,{\an7\pos(320,240)\blur2\3c&HFFFFFF&\3a&H7D&\fsp1.6\fad(273,1)}Henry Henderson (66)\N{\fs11\fsp0}\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\hHousemaster of Dorm 3 <Cecil Hall>\N\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\hSubject Taught: History\N\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\hPersonality: Elegant
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.74,0:13:41.90,italics,Henderson,0,0,0,,Elegantly done, Loid Forger.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.90,0:13:44.10,italics,Henderson,0,0,0,,I knew I saw potential in you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.10,0:13:48.61,main,Evans,0,0,0,,Now then, how would the two \Nof you describe your daughter?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.61,0:13:52.05,main,Evans,0,0,0,,Please let us know about her \Nstrengths and weaknesses.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.45,0:13:55.86,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Anya is an extremely curious child.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.37,0:13:59.99,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Her habit of sticking her nose where it \Ndoesn't belong could be seen as a weakness,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.99,0:14:01.61,main,Loid,0,0,0,,but she is a truly intelligent child.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.00,0:14:03.70,italics,Henderson,0,0,0,,Intelligent?! Her?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.70,0:14:04.12,italics,Anya,0,0,0,,Shock!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.70,0:14:08.48,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Sometimes, it's like she \Nsees right through me,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.05,0:14:08.16,italicstop,Anya,0,0,0,,Yikes...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.48,0:14:10.38,main,Loid,0,0,0,,which keeps me on my feet.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.59,0:14:13.24,main,Loid,0,0,0,,I would say her main shortcoming \Nis that she's a picky eater.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.59,0:14:18.70,main,Evan,0,0,0,,Ah...  And how would you describe \Nyour parenting style, Madam?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.70,0:14:20.13,italics,Yor,0,0,0,,Just like we practiced...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.98,0:14:25.22,main,Yor,0,0,0,,As you already know, I am \Nnot her biological mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.66,0:14:29.79,main,Yor,0,0,0,,At first, I spoiled her quite often \Nin hopes that she would like me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.79,0:14:35.44,main,Yor,0,0,0,,But for the sake of her future, I'm hoping \NI can become a bit stricter at times.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.87,0:14:39.30,main,Evans,0,0,0,,We've been told that your \Ndaughter is a picky eater.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.30,0:14:42.16,main,Evans,0,0,0,,What kind of meals do you cook at home?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.16,0:14:44.68,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Huh? C-Cook?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.68,0:14:45.45,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.45,0:14:47.89,main,Loid,0,0,0,,I actually do most of the cooking.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.89,0:14:51.84,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Though when I'm busy, my wife \Nis kind enough to cook for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.84,0:14:53.38,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,Not that that's happened even once yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.38,0:14:57.19,main,Swan,0,0,0,,You're joking! What kind of wife \Ncan't cook for her husband?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.19,0:15:00.75,main,Swan,0,0,0,,You should probably be stricter with \Nyourself before you worry about that child.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.08,0:15:03.38,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Everyone has strengths and weaknesses.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.83,0:15:07.19,main,Loid,0,0,0,,She is extremely tidy and excels \Nat keeping our house spotless.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.19,0:15:09.60,main,Loid,0,0,0,,She is also an excellent \Nmother to my daughter.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.60,0:15:13.60,main,Swan,0,0,0,,Yes, well, both of those are \Nthings women are expected to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.60,0:15:14.46,main,Loid,0,0,0,,That's—
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.46,0:15:16.09,main,Yor,0,0,0,,I-It's all right, Loid.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.09,0:15:17.79,top,Evans,0,0,0,,Now, now...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.89,0:15:18.85,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,Yes. Calm down.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.32,0:15:21.46,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,Why are you getting irritated, Twilight?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.76,0:15:25.45,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,She's not even your real wife.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.02,0:15:29.73,italics,Swan,0,0,0,,A lovey-dovey hot couple? You make me sick.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.73,0:15:32.40,italics,Swan,0,0,0,,I'll keep jabbing at you until you slip up.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.40,0:15:37.45,italics,Swan,0,0,0,,If I can't make sure these two fail, \Nthere's clearly no justice in this world.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.15,0:15:38.30,italicstop,Anya,0,0,0,,He doesn't like Papa and Mama!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.30,0:15:40.08,italics,Anya,0,0,0,,I need to do my best!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.08,0:15:44.00,main,Evans,0,0,0,,N-Next, let's ask the \Nyoung lady some questions.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.00,0:15:44.95,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,Here it comes.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.95,0:15:48.55,main,Evans,0,0,0,,First, could you tell us \Nyour name and address?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.03,0:15:50.72,main,Anya,0,0,0,,My name is Anya Holger!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.72,0:15:53.52,main,Anya,0,0,0,,My address is in... Berlint, West District...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.52,0:15:58.31,main,Anya,0,0,0,,128 Park... Avenue!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.31,0:16:01.53,main,Evans,0,0,0,,And what do you do on your \Ndays off, young lady?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.53,0:16:03.13,main,Anya,0,0,0,,We go to moozeums...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.13,0:16:04.82,main,Anya,0,0,0,,and eat operas...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.03,0:16:07.10,italicstop,Loid,0,0,0,,Good. These were questions we anticipated.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.10,0:16:10.46,main,Evans,0,0,0,,What would you like to do once \Nyou get into this school?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.46,0:16:12.46,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Um, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.46,0:16:13.53,italics,Anya,0,0,0,,What was I supposed to say?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.53,0:16:16.14,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,In my case, I first need to \Nparticipate in a social gathering,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.14,0:16:20.30,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,and get to the bottom of what the boss of \Nthe enemy organization, Desmond, is planning.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.35,0:16:22.60,top,Anya,0,0,0,,I-I want to find out what the boss \Nof the organization is planning!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.60,0:16:24.03,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,What in the world are you saying?! Hello?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.03,0:16:27.74,main,Evans,0,0,0,,The boss of the organization? \NMaybe you meant the headmaster.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.42,0:16:32.07,main,Loid,0,0,0,,I do apologize. My daughter \Nis rather ambitious.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.07,0:16:35.89,main,Loid,0,0,0,,She's extremely curious about the headmaster,\N since he's clearly made it to the top.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.89,0:16:36.76,italics,Henderson,0,0,0,,Oho...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.76,0:16:40.10,italics,Henderson,0,0,0,,The desire to learn from her \Npredecessors at such an early age...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.10,0:16:41.86,italics,Henderson,0,0,0,,That's quite elegant.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.25,0:16:45.68,main,Henderson,0,0,0,,Do you happen to know the name \Nof the principal, young lady?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.05,0:16:48.08,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Um, B-Be...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.08,0:16:50.99,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,Yes. Benedict Ivan Goodfellow.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.80,0:16:54.18,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Mr. Benedick Advent Goodheller.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.58,0:16:56.54,main,Henderson,0,0,0,,Hmm... Then,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.54,0:17:01.14,main,Henderson,0,0,0,,could you tell us how hard you would have \Nto work in order to succeed like him?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.24,0:17:04.98,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Yes. Like getting through \Nthe jungle with no supplies,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.98,0:17:09.11,main,Anya,0,0,0,,and dancing with death over \Nand over to get brave!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.42,0:17:12.70,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,That was the training montage the \Nprotagonist of her spy cartoon did yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.05,0:17:15.33,italics,Henderson,0,0,0,,S-Such incredible resolve!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.33,0:17:18.32,italics,Henderson,0,0,0,,It appears as though I have \Nunderestimated this young lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.32,0:17:21.22,main,Evans,0,0,0,,I don't think you have to do quite that much.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.62,0:17:25.67,main,Evans,0,0,0,,Let's change the subject. \NWhat does your father do for a living?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.67,0:17:29.55,main,Anya,0,0,0,,He's a sp—a speshulist in \Nmental health. A very good one.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.55,0:17:32.10,main,Evans,0,0,0,,Hm? Are you a little stuffed up?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.10,0:17:36.01,main,Evans,0,0,0,,Then how do you feel about your new mother?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.01,0:17:37.80,main,Anya,0,0,0,,She is very nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.17,0:17:40.13,main,Anya,0,0,0,,But she's scary sometimes.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.50,0:17:45.23,main,Evans,0,0,0,,If you were to give your parents \Na score, what might that be?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.18,0:17:48.26,main,Anya,0,0,0,,A perfect 100 points.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.26,0:17:51.02,main,Anya,0,0,0,,My Papa and Mama are both so \Nmuch fun, and I love them very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.49,0:17:53.39,main,Anya,0,0,0,,I want to be with them forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.52,0:17:57.66,italics,Swan,0,0,0,,Tch. God, no one needs this rubbish.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.66,0:18:01.88,main,Swan,0,0,0,,In that case, would you score your \Nold mother or your new mother higher?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.88,0:18:03.45,main,Evans,0,0,0,,Come now, Master Swan...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.45,0:18:04.33,main,Swan,0,0,0,,Is there a problem?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.33,0:18:06.39,main,Loid,0,0,0,,May I respectfully request \Na different question?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.39,0:18:09.11,main,Swan,0,0,0,,Absolutely not. If you do not \Nanswer, you will lose points.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.02,0:18:12.23,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,I don't know exactly how she \Nended up in that orphanage,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.72,0:18:15.38,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,but her actual parents \Nare probably already...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.30,0:18:24.06,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Ma...ma...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.24,0:18:26.05,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Anya...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.36,0:18:28.22,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Mama...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.22,0:18:30.05,main,Swan,0,0,0,,I see, I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.05,0:18:32.38,main,Swan,0,0,0,,So you {\i1}do{\i0} prefer your old mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.60,0:18:33.70,main,Yor,0,0,0,,This is too cruel!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.70,0:18:34.91,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Please calm down, Yor.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.91,0:18:35.62,main,Yor,0,0,0,,But this is just—
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.34,0:18:38.47,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,We need to remain calm for \Nthe sake of this mission.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.47,0:18:41.40,main,Swan,0,0,0,,We have plenty of students here who live \Naway from their parents in our dorms.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.40,0:18:45.32,main,Swan,0,0,0,,If she's going to cry over \Nevery little trifling thing,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.32,0:18:47.39,main,Swan,0,0,0,,she'll never survive at our establishment!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.39,0:18:50.06,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,So what if he's being slanderous?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.47,0:18:52.70,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,We are nothing more than a pretend family.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.97,0:18:54.59,top,Yor,0,0,0,,Trifling? You call this {\i1}trifling{\i0}?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.98,0:18:55.54,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,This is nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.82,0:18:57.73,main,Swan,0,0,0,,Now, now, Mrs. Second Wife.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.73,0:19:00.65,main,Swan,0,0,0,,Don't snap at me just because \Nshe loves her real mother more.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.65,0:19:02.44,italics,Swan,0,0,0,,Oh, I feel so much better.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.31,0:19:04.41,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,Restrain yourself...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.02,0:19:06.15,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,Twilight!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.34,0:19:15.45,main,Loid,0,0,0,,I do beg your pardon.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.35,0:19:17.91,main,Loid,0,0,0,,There was a mosquito.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.57,0:19:20.60,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Thank you very much for your time today.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.60,0:19:21.71,main,Swan,0,0,0,,Hey, where are you going?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.71,0:19:23.67,main,Swan,0,0,0,,The interview's not over yet!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.84,0:19:29.53,main,Loid,0,0,0,,If making light of a child's feelings is part \Nof your establishment's educational policies,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.53,0:19:31.73,main,Loid,0,0,0,,then I'm afraid we have \Nchosen the wrong school.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.52,0:19:35.71,main,Swan,0,0,0,,You fiend! You dare \Ndisgrace our fine school?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.71,0:19:36.70,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Come now, you two.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.41,0:19:38.62,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Please excuse us.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.95,0:19:42.27,main,Swan,0,0,0,,Don't think you'll ever walk \Nthrough our gates again!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.27,0:19:44.66,main,Henderson,0,0,0,,That's quite enough, Master Swan.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.66,0:19:46.78,main,Swan,0,0,0,,Are you taking issue with my methods?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.01,0:19:48.40,main,Swan,0,0,0,,He may be the former headmaster,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.95,0:19:50.07,top,Evans,0,0,0,,Now, now...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.40,0:19:50.89,main,Swan,0,0,0,,but my father's influence \Nwithin this school is still strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.89,0:19:54.16,main,Swan,0,0,0,,It'd be wise for you to \Nwatch that mouth of yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.00,0:19:57.67,main,Swan,0,0,0,,Hey! Hurry up and call the next one in!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.33,0:20:01.20,flashback,Loid,0,0,0,,...the instructors of the \Nprestigious Eden College
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.20,0:20:03.22,flashback italics,Loid,0,0,0,,are second to none.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.88,0:20:07.92,italics,Henderson,0,0,0,,If all I can do is curry \Nfavor with the authorities,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.92,0:20:10.30,italics,Henderson,0,0,0,,I have no right to call myself an educator.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.70,0:20:13.87,main,Henderson,0,0,0,,I must ask, who truly disgraced our school?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.87,0:20:14.57,main,Swan,0,0,0,,Huh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.93,0:20:18.15,main,Evans,0,0,0,,Wha—
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.57,0:20:19.35,main,Henderson,0,0,0,,Hmm...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.87,0:20:22.10,main,Henderson,0,0,0,,That was rather elegant, \Nif I do say so myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.71,0:20:27.71,main,Henderson,0,0,0,,Now, will you be able to face \Nthe instructors at Eden head-on,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.71,0:20:29.14,main,Henderson,0,0,0,,Forgers?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.10,0:20:35.38,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,Yeah... We definitely failed.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.95,0:20:38.59,main,Yor,0,0,0,,I-I'll go make us some tea.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.83,0:20:42.00,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,I've failed yet again as a spy.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.40,0:20:45.37,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,I let unnecessary feelings get \Nin the way of the mission.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.37,0:20:46.30,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Papa...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.85,0:20:48.26,main,Anya,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.87,0:20:52.31,main,Anya,0,0,0,,I'm so sorry that I couldn't do better
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.61,0:20:53.96,main,Anya,0,0,0,,on my tests.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.06,0:20:58.07,main,Loid,0,0,0,,It's all right, Anya. You have\N no reason to apologize.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.45,0:21:00.54,main,Loid,0,0,0,,You don't want to go to \Na school like that, do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.59,0:21:05.93,main,Anya,0,0,0,,But I want to go to school...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.93,0:21:06.86,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.86,0:21:09.27,italics,Anya Internal,0,0,0,,If this mission fails...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.27,0:21:11.47,main,Anya,0,0,0,,I have to go to school or...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.57,0:21:14.54,italics,Anya Internal,0,0,0,,...we won't be together anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.20,0:21:16.37,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Anya...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.40,0:21:21.20,italics,Yor,0,0,0,,If she fails, of course, \Nour life here together will be...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.57,0:21:24.13,italics,Yor,0,0,0,,But that doesn't matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.13,0:21:27.63,italics,Yor,0,0,0,,I'm just worried how this may affect my work.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.63,0:21:30.44,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Hmm... But to be honest,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.44,0:21:32.41,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Hell will freeze over before you pass.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.41,0:21:33.18,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Shock!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.45,0:21:35.40,main,Yor,0,0,0,,I-I'm sure everything will be okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.40,0:21:36.71,main,Yor,0,0,0,,It'll all work out!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.24,0:21:39.82,main,Anya,0,0,0,,The grandpa with the glasses and \Nthe grandpa with the half-glasses
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.82,0:21:41.01,main,Anya,0,0,0,,were really nice!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.01,0:21:42.33,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Yes, exactly!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.56,0:21:45.54,main,Yor,0,0,0,,I'm sure they'll vouch for us!\N Let's believe in them.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.75,0:21:51.72,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,Spies don't believe in anyone \Nother than themselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.18,0:21:55.82,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,They always expect the worst-case \Nscenarios and prepare for them.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.69,0:21:58.34,flashback,Anya,0,0,0,,I want to be with them forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.79,0:22:03.42,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,But... Maybe just a little bit...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.77,0:22:07.38,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Yes. Let's leave the result to fate,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.38,0:22:09.98,main,Loid,0,0,0,,and try to recover from how \Nexhausting that exam was.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.18,0:22:14.80,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,Right now, just for a little bit...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.47,0:22:17.57,main,Loid,0,0,0,,To our family's bright future!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.79,0:22:21.24,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Something just fell!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.63,0:22:24.99,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Our family portrait fell to the floor.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.99,0:22:26.11,main,Loid,0,0,0,,It just fell...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.11,0:22:27.48,italics,Narrator,0,0,0,,What will become
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.01,0:22:29.19,italics,Narrator,0,0,0,,of their mission?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.92,0:24:09.91,sign_6041_79_OPERATION_STRIX,Sign,0,0,0,,{\pos(472,290)\fscx44}WILL THEY PASS OR FAIL
